# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
# Use case: GPS on header J10 and an RC receiver on header J11.
# Load exactly one 20- file.
# Not yet tested with a real GPS or receiver: see the README.

# J10 (SERIAL1) carries the GPS; MAVLink stays on Wi-Fi.
SERIAL1_PROTOCOL 5

# Detect the GPS type and baud rate automatically.
GPS1_TYPE 1

# J11 (SERIAL4) is the RC input: a CRSF/ELRS-type serial receiver.
# SBUS needs an inverter, which this board does not have.
SERIAL4_PROTOCOL 23

# 32 = bit 5 throttle must be low to arm; bit 0 clear so the
# receiver is used (the indoor file sets it).
RC_OPTIONS 32
